    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Mankind: TD brings a new level of strategy to the Tower Defense genre. Usually, you build solid towers along the way to impede enemy movement, but what if you assembled towers from individual parts? Research technologies, unlock modules, and assemble unique towers! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/3ba5d73511173ea296f6e7c0d245ea2c.poster.avif?t=1748512435\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/3ba5d73511173ea296f6e7c0d245ea2c.webm?t=1748512435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/3ba5d73511173ea296f6e7c0d245ea2c.mp4?t=1748512435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control the battlefield </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/93717ac333040d5216dbe5c19e008de1.poster.avif?t=1748512435\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/93717ac333040d5216dbe5c19e008de1.webm?t=1748512435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/93717ac333040d5216dbe5c19e008de1.mp4?t=1748512435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use gates to block the path and force enemies to take a different route. Reroute bridges so that enemies cannot use a shorter route. Manage the battlefield to control the movement of enemy vehicles according to your tactics! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/d3aa2a0f50ebbd2b0d638c43fc39d7f0.poster.avif?t=1748512435\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/d3aa2a0f50ebbd2b0d638c43fc39d7f0.webm?t=1748512435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/d3aa2a0f50ebbd2b0d638c43fc39d7f0.mp4?t=1748512435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique opponents </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/02954fd514db9378589ac5b511264189.poster.avif?t=1748512435\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/02954fd514db9378589ac5b511264189.webm?t=1748512435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/02954fd514db9378589ac5b511264189.mp4?t=1748512435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study your enemies in a separate \u201cGlossary\u201d section - each of them has its own characteristics and vulnerabilities. Select modules for your towers according to the weaknesses of your opponents and avoid ineffective weapons.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Mankind: TD brings a new level of strategy to the Tower Defense genre. Usually, you build solid towers along the way to impede enemy movement, but what if you assembled towers from individual parts? Research technologies, unlock modules, and assemble unique towers! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/3ba5d73511173ea296f6e7c0d245ea2c.poster.avif?t=1748512435\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/3ba5d73511173ea296f6e7c0d245ea2c.webm?t=1748512435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/3ba5d73511173ea296f6e7c0d245ea2c.mp4?t=1748512435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control the battlefield </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/93717ac333040d5216dbe5c19e008de1.poster.avif?t=1748512435\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/93717ac333040d5216dbe5c19e008de1.webm?t=1748512435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/93717ac333040d5216dbe5c19e008de1.mp4?t=1748512435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use gates to block the path and force enemies to take a different route. Reroute bridges so that enemies cannot use a shorter route. Manage the battlefield to control the movement of enemy vehicles according to your tactics! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/d3aa2a0f50ebbd2b0d638c43fc39d7f0.poster.avif?t=1748512435\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/d3aa2a0f50ebbd2b0d638c43fc39d7f0.webm?t=1748512435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/d3aa2a0f50ebbd2b0d638c43fc39d7f0.mp4?t=1748512435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique opponents </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/02954fd514db9378589ac5b511264189.poster.avif?t=1748512435\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/02954fd514db9378589ac5b511264189.webm?t=1748512435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345480/extras/02954fd514db9378589ac5b511264189.mp4?t=1748512435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study your enemies in a separate \u201cGlossary\u201d section - each of them has its own characteristics and vulnerabilities. Select modules for your towers according to the weaknesses of your opponents and avoid ineffective weapons.</p>",
